    <p>
      A8 frequency is counted in <b>cycles per A8 SECOND</b>. The A8 timebase is referenced to the
      Jovian 1:2:4 recovery architecture — <b>Io ×4 · Europa ×2 · Ganymede ×1</b>.
      The conventional value below exists only so the browser audio engine can render the selected
      native A8 frequency. It is an implementation reference, not the A8 frequency ruler.
    </p>
    <div class="trainer-note">
